{"method":{"methodHash":"4886dd2cf2d715b9f1d69302ff0ebefc","typeHash":"964fda6e13e37c90a6a3ead912fb06b0","name":"Exponential","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/InputLogic/MovementPaths.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":28,"startColumn":9,"endLine":33,"endColumn":10},"calls":[{"span":{"startLine":30,"startColumn":54,"endLine":30,"endColumn":75},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Pow"},{"span":{"startLine":31,"startColumn":54,"endLine":31,"endColumn":75},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Pow"}]},"lines":["        internal static Point Exponential(Point start, Point end, double t, double exponent = 2.0)","        {","            double x = start.X \u002B (end.X - start.X) * Math.Pow(t, exponent);","            double y = start.Y \u002B (end.Y - start.Y) * Math.Pow(t, exponent);","            return new Point((int)x, (int)y);","        }"],"startLine":28}